	(label "RELAY_EXP_INT" (at 170.18 111.76 90) (fields_autoplaced yes)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "64400457-e258-472a-863d-14055a48e2ed")
	)
	(text "S12 — RELAY EXPANSION INTERFACE (8-KANAL, PCF8574 EKSTERNAL).\nSumber kontrak: docs/RELAY_INTEGRATION_ARCHITECTURE.md §2.2 + docs/\nRELAY_GPIO_HARDWARE_CONTRACT.md (PCF8574 0x20, aktif-LOW, boot 0xFF =\nsemua OFF; SDA/SCL shared GPIO21/22 — TANPA GPIO baru; INT tidak\ndipakai v1, disiapkan untuk readback kontak aux di masa depan).\nRAIL DAYA: +5V (utama, LM2596HVS) -> F4 polyfuse 1,1A hold -> FB2\nferrite 600R -> +5V_RELAY_EXP -> J.1. Beban: 8 koil relai modul\neksternal ~8 x 70 mA = 560 mA + PCF8574 + LED modul ~ 80 mA -> total\n< 700 mA; F4 1,1A hold margin ~1,6x; drop FB2/R_loop dievaluasi saat\nacceptance. TVS D24/D25 SMAJ5.0A (DNP default) ke PGND di jalur\nI2C_5V — pasang jika lingkungan industrial bernoise.\nLEVEL SHIFT I2C (R4 = BSS138, keputusan owner): bus utama 3V3\n(SHT31/DS3231/INA219, pull-up R40/R41 4k7 sheet 06) <-> sisi 5V\nPCF8574 (VIH 0,7xVCC = 3,5 V > 3,3 V ESP32 -> shifting WAJIB).\nQ22/Q23 BSS138: G=+3V3, S=bus 3V3, D=sisi 5V; R79/R84 4k7 pull-up ke\n+5V_RELAY_EXP (sisi 5V mati saat F4 putus -> bus 3V3 tetap hidup utk\nsensor on-board — isolasi fault alami). PCF8574 open-drain: LOW\nditarik dua arah via body-diode BSS138 (topologi standar).\nINT: J.6 -> R82 10k / R83 15k (0,6) -> RELAY_EXP_INT (label lokal,\n3,0 V saat HIGH). v1 firmware TIDAK memakai INT; GPIO13/23/33 bebas\ntetap direserve J_EXP (sheet 11) — penyambungan INT = jumper wire\nsaat fitur readback diaktifkan (dokumentasi TEST_PLAN)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 130 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "56a5c6d3-5122-4e62-a973-f3fe1d3adaad")	)
	(text "PINOUT J_RELAY_EXP (2x03, PinHeader_2.54 vertikal):\n  Pin 1 = +5V_RELAY_EXP   Pin 2 = PGND\n  Pin 3 = I2C_SDA_5V      Pin 4 = PGND\n  Pin 5 = I2C_SCL_5V      Pin 6 = RELAY_EXP_INT_5V\nGND pin ganda (2/4) mereduksi loop arus koil pada kabel ribbon.\nVERIFIKASI ACCEPTANCE (item TEST_PLAN S12):\n  1. Bus 3V3 tetap berfungsi (SHT31/DS3231/INA219 terbaca) saat\n     modul relai TIDAK terpasang (F4/FB2 terbuka ringan).\n  2. PCF8574 terdeteksi di 0x20; tulis 0xFF -> semua relai OFF.\n  3. Latency toggle 8 kanal < 10 ms @ 100 kHz I2C.\n  4. Drop tegangan +5V_RELAY_EXP saat 8 koil simultan ON < 250 mV\n     (C52 47uF sheet 01 menahan dip; LM2596 3A headroom).\n  5. Crosstalk: tidak ada glitch SDA/SCL saat koil switching\n     (snubber/flyback modul eksternal harus ada — kontrak §12)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225 130 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "6977e778-25bf-458c-8eeb-66018b28bb3c")	)
	(text_box "12_RELAY_EXP — antarmuka ekspansi relai 8-kanal (S12; arsitektur §2.2).\n+5V -> F4 1,1A -> FB2 600R -> +5V_RELAY_EXP -> J_RELAY_EXP (2x03).\nI2C: bus 3V3 global (SDA/SCL) -> BSS138 Q22/Q23 -> sisi 5V (R79/R84\n4k7 pull-up +5V_RELAY_EXP) -> J.3/J.5. TVS D24/D25 DNP. INT J.6 ->\nR82/R83 0,6 -> RELAY_EXP_INT (lokal, future GPIO13/23/33).\nPCF8574 (0x20) + 8 relai + driver ada di MODUL EKSTERNAL; kontrak\naktif-LOW + boot 0xFF semua OFF (fail-safe); E-WAVE GPIO27 tetap\nterisolasi dari sistem ini (Safety Boundary §4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 40)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "4d47a102-32a2-48a8-b17d-eb530cddcacb")
	)
